4-apple-music-insights-royalty-rate","https://support.distrokid.com/hc/en-us/articles/360013547274-How-and-When-Do-I-Get-Paid","https://www.consumerfinance.gov/archive/blog/budgeting-how-to-create-a-budget-and-stick-with-it/","https://royaltyexchange.com/how-auctions-work-sellers","https://www.beatbread.com/faq","https://www.copyright.gov/title17/92chap2.html#204"]}</script><script id="seo-schema-1" type="application/ld+json" data-rh="true">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://spacemusic.io/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"How to Sell Your Music Catalog for a Lump Sum in 2026","item":"https://spacemusic.io/blog/sell-music-catalog-lump-sum-2026/"}]}</script><style id="space-blog-style" data-rh="true">.space-blog-article {
